      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This happens to me, sub 40 fps until I open my social list and intense frame drops / freezing when scrolling through lists like worlds and social. After closing my menu it shoots up to 90 FPS. Basically any time I open the menu I drop to 40 fps from the 90 that I had.",
