      "mergeID": "640f6cff77cc75452527db0e",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Watch this video:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WXAdRprnKOY\n\nThere is problem in one of the lists. It's list where you can see Friends in which worlds. It's nice feature and it sum everything up, makes easier to join friends.\n\nBut there is problem. Compared to other lists, this list is extremely heavy, got big framedrop to 12 fps, and game feels laggy with this list. It's clearly not good, because other lists are fine, website version is fine, but ingame... is so bad.\n\nIt has even some risk it can crash VRChat. If you're in busy world, your fps drop will even more lower!\n\nPlease, try optimize this list. I use it a lot to find friends, but it's not nice to scroll it with huge lagspikes.\n\nNot sure Quest side is affected too.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1287] Heavy scrolling Friend Locations list.",
