      "value": "This drop of performance is really serious.\n\nIf you have almost 6000 friends, you can't even scroll.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/CKKCOBALT/status/1651530183005044736\n\nThis issue also occurs when a player in an same instance is selected directly with the cursor and show their details.\n\nThis is because that social page is interrupt when displaying the user's details.",
