      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems that the cause and troubleshooting for this bug have been found.\n\nTroubleshoot 1:\n\nClear Local Profile Data in Debug menu\n\nhttps://twitter.com/0tdrv_/status/1651807815974125580?s=20\n\nTroubleshoot 2:\n\nDelete \"FriendsPerLocation.~~ key\" in Windows Registry \\HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\SOFTWARE\\VRChat\\VRChat\n\nand Reboot Windows\n\nhttps://twitter.com/nekochanfood/status/1653584216465240064?s=20\n\nExample Video after troubleshooting:\n\nhttps://twitter.com/nekochanfood/status/1653571687919808514?s=20",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
